{"seq": 51, "ts": "2026-11-03T03:08:30.887488+00:00", "type": "crosscheck_verdict", "claim_index": 0, "contradiction_id": "C-001", "text": "Every admin account is behind MFA. No exceptions. That's been true for years. It's enforced through our conditional access policy.", "verdict": "contradicted", "severity": "high", "refs": ["F-010", "E-015"], "excerpt": "Exception noted. 4 of 25 sampled admin accounts were not enforced for MFA. These were service-desk accounts created via a legacy provisioning script that bypassed the conditional access policy."}
