{"seq": 53, "ts": "2026-11-03T03:08:30.888043+00:00", "type": "crosscheck_verdict", "claim_index": 2, "contradiction_id": "C-003", "text": "We have a 24 7 SOC through our MSSP, every alert gets looked at, nothing sits.", "verdict": "contradicted", "severity": "high", "refs": ["F-012", "E-017"], "excerpt": "Exception noted. For 2 consecutive weeks (Nov 10\u201323, 2025), alerts were forwarded to a decommissioned distribution list and were not reviewed."}
